Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:52.95,Hook,,0,0,0,,CONFÍA EN MÍ, ES UN\NATAJO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Creo que el dinosaurio me\Nvolteó y no me di cuenta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No mames, cabrón!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Uf… Eso estuvo muy cerca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Solo porque manejé moto en\Nla vida real me salvé de\Nesa, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Si no, no salía de esta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Uy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:21.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Confía en mí, esto es un\Natajo. No…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:24.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}…veo nada. ¡Uy, a la\Nverga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}O sea, no vi nada por un\Nsegundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:32.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Es por acá?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:37.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me maté yo solo. Nadie me\Nmató.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:40.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me estrellé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Lo bueno es que manejé\Nmoto en la vida real,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}si no, no hubiera podido.\NOtra vez.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:45.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ah, la mierda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:47.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Casi me mato, wey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Pero lo hice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Escapé!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:52.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Escapé de Sunnybrook!
